                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "To those asking, but what have you done?  \n\nThanks to @JoeBiden, Medicare premiums went down this year for the first time in a decade.  \n\nThat alone left seniors with more Social Security $, and then benefits went up by $140 per month.\n\nTrump never did that.  The GOP never will.",
